{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUE SPORTS: REDEFINED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i><strong>Pure Pool Pro</strong></i>, the sequel to the critically acclaimed <i><strong>Pure Pool</strong></i>. Delivering hyper-realistic physics, pinpoint-precise controls, and stunning native 8K visuals on supported platforms, Pure Pool Pro raises the bar with refined AI opponents, competitive online play and new immersive playing environments designed for both newcomers and seasoned pros.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/4fb013d724e18261e0f87eb2d987bb49.poster.avif?t=1759326648\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/4fb013d724e18261e0f87eb2d987bb49.webm?t=1759326648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/4fb013d724e18261e0f87eb2d987bb49.mp4?t=1759326648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER EVERY MODE &amp; BUILD YOUR CAREER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb from rookie to becoming a Pure Pool Pro in Career Mode, progressing through hundreds of events across 8-Ball, 9-Ball, Blackball, and Killer. Tackle high-pressure tournaments, earn accolades, and cement your place at the top of the leaderboards. Challenge yourself further in fast-paced mini-games like Speed Pot, Checkpoint, and Royal Rumble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/6b6dc2549cd9b24dc14a92e9cfcb75ae.avif?t=1759326648\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><strong>REAL-TIME ONLINE MATCHES WITH CROSS-PLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on friends and rivals around the globe in seamless multiplayer with full cross-play support. Whether it\u2019s casual matches or ranked play, the competition never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/9bf7542f2ac56acf0bedd1909ca16dec.poster.avif?t=1759326648\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/9bf7542f2ac56acf0bedd1909ca16dec.webm?t=1759326648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/9bf7542f2ac56acf0bedd1909ca16dec.mp4?t=1759326648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIFELIKE AI OPPONENTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 20 uniquely skilled AI challengers, each with their own personality and strategy. These adaptive players react to your own style, keeping every frame unpredictable and authentic to real-world cue sports.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWO ICONIC VENUES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in the high-energy, 1,000-seat Tetradome or the intimate, luxurious Rackhaus pool hall atop a skyscraper. Each venue offers a distinct atmosphere befitting of professional pool.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/884c6323520b249c92afb2d0d891912f.poster.avif?t=1759326648\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/884c6323520b249c92afb2d0d891912f.webm?t=1759326648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/884c6323520b249c92afb2d0d891912f.mp4?t=1759326648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>CUTTING-EDGE VISUALS &amp; SLEEK INTERFACE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy lifelike lighting, ray-traced reflections, and incredibly detailed table surfaces, complete with baize fuzz and clear coat imperfections. A streamlined, intuitive interface keeps you in the game with less waiting and more playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/e8598d2b410d9080027d931154f8693d.avif?t=1759326648\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMISE YOUR STYLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cues, balls, baize colours, and table designs to create your signature look. Earn profile crests for trick shots, perfect frames, and other feats that show off your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/77b8df56fb847980f7cbab30e21575cc.avif?t=1759326648\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play to over 20 tracks spanning chilled jazz - a nod to the fan-favourite music from the original - to high-energy beats perfect for high-stakes play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014<br><br><strong>***WISHLIST NOW</strong>***<br>Ready for the Pros. Pure Pool Pro is coming soon! Add it to your wishlist and be among the first to experience the future of cue sports.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3456930?t=1759326648","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3456930?t=1759326648","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/1f51375665129bbbb94f18dd1931766a186d4656/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759326648","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/1f51375665129bbbb94f18dd1931766a186d4656/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759326648","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3969200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUE SPORTS: REDEFINED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i><strong>Pure Pool Pro</strong></i>, the sequel to the critically acclaimed <i><strong>Pure Pool</strong></i>. Delivering hyper-realistic physics, pinpoint-precise controls, and stunning native 8K visuals on supported platforms, Pure Pool Pro raises the bar with refined AI opponents, competitive online play and new immersive playing environments designed for both newcomers and seasoned pros.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/4fb013d724e18261e0f87eb2d987bb49.poster.avif?t=1759326648\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/4fb013d724e18261e0f87eb2d987bb49.webm?t=1759326648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st