ragraph\" >Face 20 uniquely skilled AI challengers, each with their own personality and strategy. These adaptive players react to your own style, keeping every frame unpredictable and authentic to real-world cue sports.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWO ICONIC VENUES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in the high-energy, 1,000-seat Tetradome or the intimate, luxurious Rackhaus pool hall atop a skyscraper. Each venue offers a distinct atmosphere befitting of professional pool.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/884c6323520b249c92afb2d0d891912f.poster.avif?t=1759326648\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/884c6323520b249c92afb2d0d891912f.webm?t=1759326648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/884c6323520b249c92afb2d0d891912f.mp4?t=1759326648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>CUTTING-EDGE VISUALS &amp; SLEEK INTERFACE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy lifelike lighting, ray-traced reflections, and incredibly detailed table surfaces, complete with baize fuzz and clear coat imperfections. A streamlined, intuitive interface keeps you in the game with less waiting and more playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/e8598d2b410d9080027d931154f8693d.avif?t=1759326648\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMISE YOUR STYLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cues, balls, baize colours, and table designs to create your signature look. Earn profile crests for trick shots, perfect frames, and other feats that show off your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/extras/77b8df56fb847980f7cbab30e21575cc.avif?t=1759326648\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play to over 20 tracks spanning chilled jazz - a nod to the fan-favourite music from the original - to high-energy beats perfect for high-stakes play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014<br><br><strong>***WISHLIST NOW</strong>***<br>Ready for the Pros. Pure Pool Pro is coming soon! Add it to your wishlist and be among the first to experience the future of cue sports.</p>","developers":["Rockwater"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456930/76816eaf4db544d10a2a411b3545173a4dc5d806/header.jpg?t=1759326648","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Pure Pool Pro \u00a9 2025 Ripstone Ltd. Developed by Rockwater Games, a Ripstone Studio. Pure Pool\u00ae is a registered trademark of Ripstone Ltd. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3456930/947196768/82159184fa1ec8b87150240f845b032afb602a82/1753347256/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753349112","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3456930/947196768/82159184fa1ec8b87150240f845b032afb602a82/1753347256/dash_h264.mpd?t=17533